   "text": "Hold back test items\n  sampler-agent\n  subjective-label-test\nLock blind answers for the final test\n  gallery-keeper-agent\n  subjective-label-test\nHave one registered model predict the test\n  labeler-panel-agent\n  subjective-label-evaluation\nScore one closed set of predictions\n  validator-agent\n  subjective-label-evaluation\nSelect from the complete scorecard set\n  validator-agent\n  subjective-label-evaluation\nDraw from one frozen audit design\n  sampler-agent\n  subjective-label-audit\nBlind-label one audit sample\n  moderator-agent\n  subjective-label-audit\nAnalyze one completed audit sample\n  validator-agent\n  subjective-label-audit",
   "originalText": "Hold back test items\n  sampler-agent\n  subjective-label-test\nLock blind answers for the final test\n  gallery-keeper-agent\n  subjective-label-test\nHave one registered model predict the test\n  labeler-panel-agent\n  subjective-label-evaluation\nScore one closed set of predictions\n  validator-agent\n  subjective-label-evaluation\nSelect from the complete scorecard set\n  validator-agent\n  subjective-label-evaluation\nDraw from one frozen audit design\n  sampler-agent\n  subjective-label-audit\nBlind-label one audit sample\n  moderator-agent\n  subjective-label-audit\nAnalyze one completed audit sample\n  validator-agent\n  subjective-label-audit",
