   "text": "Freeze a stopped labeling lineage\n  gallery-keeper-agent\n  subjective-label-handoff\nCheck one frozen production plan\n  labeling-checker-agent (new)\n  subjective-label-scan\nLabel one frozen corpus shard\n  labeler-panel-agent\n  subjective-label-scan\nRoute risky production items to review\n  classifier-agent\n  subjective-label-scan\nYou label one production risk queue\n  moderator-agent\n  subjective-label-scan\nReconcile reviewed items into a candidate corpus\n  gallery-keeper-agent\n  subjective-label-scan\nPublish an accepted audited corpus\n  gallery-keeper-agent\n  subjective-label-final-labels",
